source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: An effect's content may not begin with its own delimiter, and a recognized brace form is passed over whole, so the `*` behind the braces opens.
-- input.jira --
a{*}*b*{*}c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a{*}<b>b</b>{*}c</p>
-- want.md --
a{\*}**b**{\*}c
-- warnings.json --
[]
